WSGI - Web Server Gateway Interface
This is used by Flask Framework to built the connection between the web server and the web app.
So that the the web server can redirect the requests to the web app and response from app can be sent back to server
through this.

Jinja2 - Web Template Engine
Used to combine a layout of a web page and a data source(Ml model, Sql database, csv sheet) to create a dynamic web page.